{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L0phcmhlYWQlMjAyJTIwRmllbGQlMjBPZiUyMEZpcmUlMjAlMjgyMDE0JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Jarhead 2 Field Of Fire","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/s3LkjkwmmhECqQyCuJLG1t009Qq.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e3mb4TdBQi0KitKjgrK4b737jch.jpg","description":"Battle-scarred and disillusioned by the war, Corporal Chris Merrimette is put in charge of a unit whose next mission is to resupply a remote outpost on the edge of Taliban-controlled territory. While driving through the hostile Helmand province, a Navy SEAL flags down their convoy and enlists the unit on an operation of international importance: they must help an Afghan woman famous for her defiance of the Taliban escape the country. Without tanks or air support, Merrimette and his team will need all the courage and firepower they can muster to fight their way across the war-torn country and shepherd the woman to safety.\n\nRated R · Released 14 Aug 2014 · United States of America · Language: English · 103 min\nStudio: UFO International Productions, Universal 1440 Entertainment\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["War","Action","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.2","imdb_id":"tt3699508","moviedb_id":285423,"tmdbId":285423,"runtime":"103 min","cast":["Josh Kelly","Danielle Savre","Cole Hauser","Ralitsa Paskaleva","Bokeem Woodbine","Jesse Garcia","Esai Morales","Stephen Lang"],"director":["Don Michael Paul"],"writer":["Berkeley Anderson","Ellis Black"],"released":"2014-08-14T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Find the courage, fight together.","country":"United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Don Michael Paul","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/68anBJK0vHrbwiORHh8NDaoOaLH.jpg"},{"name":"Josh Kelly","character":"Chris Merrimette","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7VAf3hHE3MbmCZJHUYo2HAfwMOW.jpg"},{"name":"Daniell